OL,3,GNEWSASpecial school's relocation could
OL,4,Amake it among UK's biggest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA specialist school in Coventry is
OL,7,Frelocating in a #26m project to become
OL,8,Fthe biggest of its kind in the country.
OL,10,FThe number of students who need SEMH
OL,11,F(social, emotional and mental health)
OL,12,Fsupport from Woodfield School is so
OL,13,Fhigh, they are moving to the nearby
OL,14,Fformer Woodlands Academy after October
OL,15,Fhalf-term.
OL,17,FThe current site, which used to be the
OL,18,Fold Meadows residential boys school,
OL,19,Fstill has original features such as
OL,20,Fbathtubs next to classrooms and even
OL,21,Fbars on the windows in one room.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
