OL,3,GNEWSASpecial school's relocation could
OL,4,Amake it among UK's biggest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe older pupils from the school and
OL,7,Fthe primary school students, who have
OL,8,Fbeen based at a site on Stoneleigh
OL,9,FRoad, will all be taught in the new
OL,10,Flocation from November.
